{"chars": "The bee wobbled forward. She stuck out her long, thin tongue and began to drink, sip, sip, sip. Santa and Mrs. Claus held very still and waited. And slowly, slowly, the bee's wings stopped trembling. They began to hum. Bzzz. Then louder. BZZZZZ. And up she rose, circled once around Mrs. Claus's head, as if to say thank you, and zoomed off toward the Ice Orchid. She landed right on one of the pink star-shaped flowers and crawled inside.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.35, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 0.613, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.012, 1.725, 1.825, 1.825, 1.825, 1.825, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 1.975, 2.212, 2.212, 2.212, 2.212, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.362, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.5, 2.85, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 2.9, 3.163, 3.163, 3.163, 3.163, 3.163, 3.163, 3.163, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.475, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.587, 3.875, 3.875, 3.875, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.0, 4.3, 4.362, 4.362, 4.362, 4.362, 4.625, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.688, 4.95, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.013, 5.7, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 5.838, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.338, 6.338, 6.338, 6.338, 6.338, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 6.975, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 7.525, 7.812, 7.812, 7.812, 7.812, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 7.925, 8.675, 8.775, 8.775, 8.775, 8.775, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 8.938, 9.375, 9.425, 9.425, 9.425, 9.425, 9.425, 9.425, 9.425, 9.85, 9.925, 9.925, 9.925, 9.925, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.3, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 11.675, 11.775, 11.775, 11.775, 11.775, 11.775, 11.9, 11.9, 11.9, 11.9, 11.9, 11.9, 12.25, 12.25, 12.25, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12.95, 13.062, 13.062, 13.062, 13.062, 13.062, 14.2, 14.3, 14.3, 14.3, 14.3, 14.3, 14.525